SPARSKIT2
=========

Get the package from:

http://www-users.cs.umn.edu/~saad/software/SPARSKIT

Unpack

Now you can either:

1) Build sparskit yourself and add the library to your Mdefs.mk

   or

2) Edit the script getsk and run it from this directory. Typing

      make

   in this directory or

      make sparskit2 

   for the tfem root directory will update your solver lib with the 
   sparskit routines.

NOTE: if you compile with default 64bit integers the file color.f needs
to be patched by

   patch color.f <color.diff

